|term[reference-act] :status settled :defined-by def-descriptors :anchor reference-act
  :word reference-act
  :alternates [reference-acts act]
  |quote
    "The address you gave us is ambiguous and there are several people by that name it might end up with." — the refused package that opens the postal model
  The act of supplying [[term/descriptor]]s that narrow the world down to an intended [[term/referent]].
  |invariants
    - Has one or more [[term/descriptor]]
    - Carries exactly one [[term/expected-cardinality]]
    - Targets one or more [[term/referent]]
    - Resolved by a [[term/resolution-engine]], never by the act itself
